{"name":"单页滚动布局","description":"单页滚动布局是指将相关内容按阅读顺序组织在同一长页面中的布局方式。 · 活动页或产品介绍常在一页中依次呈现问题、价值、证据和 CTA 。页面很长时应提供清楚章节、页内跳转和返回路径；内容若分别服务不同任务，就应拆成多个页面，而不是强迫用户一直滚动。 先知道 顶部导航栏 Navbar 首屏 Hero CTA 页脚 Footer","quote":"所有内容放在一个长页面里，往下滚就能看完。","agentPrompt":"请把落地页组织成单页滚动结构，依次呈现问题、价值、产品证据、客户证明和 CTA。章节使用稳定锚点，长页提供返回路径，主要行动在合适阶段重复但保持同一目标。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-single-page-layout\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>单页滚动布局<span>Single Page</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">所有内容放在一个长页面里，往下滚就能看完。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">单页滚动布局是指将相关内容按阅读顺序组织在同一长页面中的布局方式。</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>活动页或产品介绍常在一页中依次呈现问题、价值、证据和<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/cta?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"cta\" aria-label=\"CTA\">CTA</a>。页面很长时应提供清楚章节、页内跳转和返回路径；内容若分别服务不同任务，就应拆成多个页面，而不是强迫用户一直滚动。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/navbar?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"navbar\">顶部导航栏 <b>Navbar</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/hero?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"hero\">首屏 <b>Hero</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/cta?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"cta\">CTA</a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/footer?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"footer\">页脚 <b>Footer</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>单页布局</em><em>长页面</em><em>Single Page Layout</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo responsive-detail-demo diagram-detail-demo\" style=\"--detail-demo-width:400px\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"single-site-demo\">\n    <div class=\"single-site-browser\">\n      <div class=\"single-site-chrome\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>vibeflow.app</span></div>\n      <div class=\"single-site-page\">\n        <nav class=\"single-site-nav\"><b>VibeFlow</b><span>功能  案例  定价</span><em>免费开始</em></nav>\n        <section class=\"single-site-hero\">\n          <small>AI WORKSPACE</small>\n          <strong>把灵感变成真正的产品</strong>\n          <p>描述你的想法,AI 帮你设计、构建并上线。</p>\n          <button>免费开始 <span>→</span></button>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"single-site-features\">\n          <div><i>✦</i><b>一句话生成</b><span>从想法直接开始</span></div>\n          <div><i>⌘</i><b>边聊边修改</b><span>像搭档一样协作</span></div>\n          <div><i>↗</i><b>一键发布</b><span>获得公开网址</span></div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"single-site-proof\"><span><b>可信证据</b>需使用已授权、可核验资料</span><i>客户 A  客户 B  客户 C</i></section>\n        <section class=\"single-site-final\"><div><b>开始创建你的第一个产品</b><span>免费开始，无需信用卡</span></div><button>立即创建</button></section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请把落地页组织成单页滚动结构，依次呈现问题、价值、产品证据、客户证明和 CTA。章节使用稳定锚点，长页提供返回路径，主要行动在合适阶段重复但保持同一目标。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>锚点导航</b>：钉在页边的分节目录，交给 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/anchor?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"锚点 Anchor\">锚点 <b>Anchor</b></a></div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:8px;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:65%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:75%\"></i></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;border-left:2px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">产品特性</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">定价</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--brand);\"><i style=\"position:absolute;left:-2px;top:5px;bottom:5px;width:2px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></i>客户评价</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">FAQ</span></div></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>按信息关系划分章节</b>：每节承担清楚任务；章节高度由内容决定，不强求正好占满一屏</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:stretch\"><span style=\"width:42px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">核心价值</span><span style=\"width:42px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">主要优势</span><span style=\"width:42px;height:40px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border:1px solid var(--brand)\">下一步</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">按照价值、主要优势、证据和行动组织完整阅读顺序</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">核心价值</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">主要优势</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag gray\">可信证据</span><span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">→</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">下一步</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>滚动跟随高亮</b>：读到哪一节，目录亮到哪</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"align-items:stretch;gap:8px;flex-wrap:nowrap\"><div style=\"flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:88%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:72%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;border-left:2px solid var(--border-light)\"><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">安装</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--brand);\"><i style=\"position:absolute;left:-2px;top:5px;bottom:5px;width:2px;background:var(--brand);border-radius:2px\"></i>快速上手</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">API</span><span style=\"position:relative;padding:2px 10px;font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;\">常见问题</span></div></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">滚到「快速上手」，目录自动高亮</span></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"usage-box dont\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 7l10 10M17 7 7 17\"></path></svg></span>什么时候不用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">长页面<b>缺少锚点和返回顶部</b>：提供 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/back-top?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"back-top\" aria-label=\"回到顶部 Back to Top Button\">回到顶部 <b>Back to Top Button</b></a> 等导航路径</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap\"><span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:10px;height:56px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:99px\"><span style=\"position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;right:2px;height:8px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--red)\"></span></span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">同一章节混入多个无关任务，<b>阅读主线会变得不清楚</b>；按信息关系拆分或重排</div><div class=\"mk bad\"><span style=\"width:76px;height:46px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:2px;padding:3px;border:1.5px solid var(--red);border-radius:4px;background:var(--bg)\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">价值</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">优势</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">证据</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">定价</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">FAQ</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:2px;padding:0 2px\">下一步</span></span></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">多模块后台系统通常使用 <a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/sidebar-layout?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"sidebar-layout\" aria-label=\"左侧栏布局 Sidebar\">左侧栏布局 <b>Sidebar</b></a>，而非单页布局</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row \"><span class=\"mk-input\"><em>🔍 搜索用户名</em></span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">新建用户</span></div><div style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border-light)\"></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box on\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">林小hu</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">管理员</span></div><div class=\"mk-row \"><i class=\"mk-box\"></i><span style=\"color:var(--text)\">阿油</span><span style=\"flex:1\"></span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">成员</span></div></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\">主要行动只在结尾出现一次，<b>阅读过程中没有可用入口</b></div><div class=\"mk bad\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:stretch\"><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">价值</span><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">优势</span><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text-2);border:1px solid var(--border)\">优势</span><span style=\"width:30px;height:34px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;border-radius:3px;background:var(--brand);color:var(--on-brand);border:1px solid var(--brand)\">下一步</span></div></div></li></ul></div></div><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"single-wire single-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"hero\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen hook\">核心价值</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"features\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen\">主要优势</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"proof\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen\">可信证据</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cta\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen cta\">行动号召</span></span></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"hero\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">核心价值</span><span class=\"pe\">Hero</span></button><span class=\"pd\">说明产品面向谁、解决什么问题，并提供明确下一步</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"features\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">主要优势</span><span class=\"pe\">Features</span></button><span class=\"pd\">按用户任务组织关键能力，避免同级信息过多</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"proof\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">可信证据</span><span class=\"pe\">Proof</span></button><span class=\"pd\">使用已授权、可核验的案例、数据或评价支撑主张</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"cta\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">4</span><span class=\"pn\">行动号召</span><span class=\"pe\">CTA</span></button><span class=\"pd\">在合适的阅读节点提供清楚的下一步入口</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">锚点导航<span>Anchors</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span style=\"display:flex;gap:5px;align-items:stretch\"><span class=\"single-wire\" style=\"width:74px\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen hook\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen cta\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span><span style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;justify-content:center\"><i style=\"width:18px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--brand)\"></i><i style=\"width:18px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover)\"></i><i style=\"width:18px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:var(--bg-hover)\"></i></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">段落多，需要随时跳转</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">纯滚动<span>Pure Scroll</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><span class=\"single-wire\" style=\"width:74px\"><span class=\"single-wire-screen hook\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen\" style=\"height:14px\"></span><span class=\"single-wire-screen cta\" style=\"height:14px\"></span></span></div><div class=\"variant-when\">三四屏讲完的小落地页</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">带回到顶部<span>BackTop</span></div><div class=\"variant